      "text": "Guaranteed to hear it. It's on the sign.",
      "words": 8
    },
    {
      "id": "L006",
      "scene": 1,
      "character": "ROY",
      "text": "So you've invented a Post Office where the bloke behind the glass is also the problem.",
      "words": 16
    },
    {
      "id": "L007",
      "scene": 1,
      "character": "GARY",
      "text": "Under-fourteens go free. Shows we're a community business.",
